---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="隐私说明" description="Codex Venture 如何使用站点统计和浏览器本地设置。How Codex Venture uses site measurement and local preferences.">
  <div class="article">
    <h1 class="page-heading">隐私说明<span lang="en">Privacy</span></h1>
    <div class="prose">
      <p lang="zh-CN">网站由 Cloudflare 托管。启用 Cloudflare Web Analytics 时，浏览器会发送页面访问和性能指标，帮助我们了解哪些内容被阅读及页面加载表现。Cloudflare Web Analytics 不使用 Cookie 或访客指纹来衡量访问。</p>
      <p lang="en">Cloudflare hosts this website. When Cloudflare Web Analytics is enabled, browsers send page activity and performance metrics to help us understand readership and page load performance. Cloudflare Web Analytics measures traffic without cookies or visitor fingerprinting.</p>
      <p lang="zh-CN">我们使用搜索引擎提供的汇总搜索表现数据。明暗主题偏好保存在当前浏览器的本地存储中。</p>
      <p lang="en">We use aggregate search performance data from search engines. Your light or dark theme preference is saved in this browser's local storage.</p>
      <p lang="zh-CN">启用 Google 统计或第三方广告后，可在隐私设置中选择加入或撤回，启用 Google 统计时也可从页首进入。Google 可能使用 Cookie 进行访问统计、展示广告和防范无效流量。广告同意也可通过广告服务提供的隐私界面管理。</p>
      <p lang="en">When Google Analytics or third-party ads are available, use Privacy settings to opt in or withdraw. When Google Analytics is available, the header also links to these settings. Google may use cookies for measurement, advertising and invalid traffic prevention. The advertising provider also offers a privacy interface for ad consent.</p>
      <p lang="zh-CN">Cloudflare 处理安全与请求诊断。推广链接通往第三方网站，供应商可能在其网站上记录转化。请通过联系我们页面提交隐私问题。</p>
      <p lang="en">Cloudflare processes security and request diagnostics. Affiliate links lead to third-party sites where providers may record conversions. Use the contact page for privacy questions.</p>
      <p><a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/web-analytics/">Cloudflare Web Analytics</a> · <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites">Google</a> · <a href="/contact/">联系 / Contact</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
